{"availability":"available","full":"sj817/shotium","name":"shotium","description":"High-performance static HTML/CSS screenshot engine powered by a stripped Chromium Blink core. / 基于 Chromium 深度裁剪的高性能静态 HTML/CSS 截图引擎","category":"Design","language":"C++","stars":13,"forks":3,"created":"2026-08-18T10:29:43Z","updated":"2026-10-11T05:00:24Z","license":"BSD-3-Clause","branch":"main","homepage":"https://sj817.github.io/shotium/","topics":["blink","c-plus-plus","chromium","cli","docker","golang","headless-chrome","html-to-image","nodejs","playwright-alternative","png","puppeteer-alternative","python","rendering-engine","screenshot","server-side-rendering","skia","typescript","web-fonts","webp"],"demo":"https://sj817.github.io/shotium/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:22.778Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:22.778Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:22.778Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T07:26:22.778Z","stars":13,"forks":3}],"technologies":["Node.js","Python","Go"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A static HTML/CSS screenshot engine cut out of Chromium: Blink, Skia and the network stack, without a browser around them","shotium extracts the core rendering pipeline from Chromium: Blink for DOM parsing, CSS styling, layout and painting, Skia for CPU rasterisation and image encoding, and //net for resource fetching and HTTP caching. It strips out all unnecessary browser shell components: V8, the //content layer, multi-process architecture, compositor, GPU process, and DevTools","The CPU renderer supports empty transparent backdrop-filter elements, CSS 3D depth ordering with intersecting planes, and backface-visibility: hidden. Large backdrop blurs allocate temporary image buffers; shared intersection edges can differ by one pixel from Chrome's GPU renderer. See the Windows size, memory and rendering checks."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sj817/shotium/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"224f737ef59d